# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# .editorconfig declares `end_of_line = lf`. Without this file, a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF, and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes`
# then reports every file as needing changes on a Windows CI runner while passing on
# Linux. Pinning the checkout encoding keeps the format gate consistent across
# Windows, Linux and macOS contributors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.snk binary
